<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria says sells cement stake to Lafarge.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria says sells cement stake to Lafarge.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria said on Wednesday it had sold its remaining 12 percent stake in Austrian cement works Perlmooser AG to France's Lafarge for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>A Bank Austria spokesman said the sale was in keeping with Bank Austria's strategy of reducing its industrial holdings.</p>
<p>Perlmooser shares closed at 628 schillings on Wednesday, putting the market value of the deal at around 360 million schillings.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
